rts large solar panel arrays for maximum daytime power generation.</li><li><b>Wide MPPT Voltage Range (60–450V DC)</b> - Ensures efficient solar harvesting even in low-light or variable conditions.</li><li><b>48V Battery System Compatibility</b> - Works with both Lead-acid and Lithium batteries.</li><li><b>Hybrid Power Operation</b> - Seamlessly combines Solar + Battery + Grid for uninterrupted power supply.</li><li><b>Fast Automatic Switching</b> - UPS-grade transfer time of 10–20ms protects devices from sudden power interruptions.</li><li><b>Can Operate Without Battery</b> - Ideal for users who want a solar-only daytime setup or plan to add batteries later.</li><li><b>Smart Monitoring Ready</b> - Supports BMS communication (RS485 / CAN) and optional WiFi monitoring.</li><li><b>Compact &amp; Lightweight Design</b> - Saves installation space while offering powerful inverter performance.</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Must PV18-3024 ECO 3000VA Pure Sine Wave Solar Inverter","href":"/must-pv18-3024-eco-3000va-pure-sine-wave-solar-inverter","now":"32,500৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-UT2000 SOHO Inverter","href":"/marsriva-mr-ut2000-soho-inverter","now":"44,500৳","old":"45,500৳","single":""},{"name":"Marsriva MR-SPF3.6K-LP1-TL20E Solar Inverter","href":"/marsriva-mr-spf36k-lp1-tl20e-solar-inverter","now":"","old":"","single":"34,000৳"},{"name":"Marsriva MR-SPF2K-LP1-TL20E Solar Inverter","href":"/marsriva-mr-spf2k-lp1-tl20e-solar-inverter","now":"","old":"","single":"28,000৳"}]},{"title":"Video","active":false,"cls":"tab-5","noExpand":true,"kind":"empty"},{"title":"Review","active":false,"cls":"tab-6","noExpand":false,"kind":"review"}],"side":{"title":"From Same Brand","items":[{"href":"/marsiva-mr-uf1200-1200va-smart-line-interactive-ups","image":{"src":"/image/cache/catalog/Marsiva/MR-UF1200/MR-UF1200-5